WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.600
Open the project's Canvas

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.300
Click New Canvas

3
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.100
Choose Live Notes › Lecture / Meeting

4
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.700
Start Recording when the meeting begins

5
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.400
The transcript appears as people speak — on this device

6
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.900
Take notes beside the transcript — each note keeps its moment

7
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:38.900
Type your notes while the meeting runs

8
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.500
Stop when the meeting ends

9
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Each note keeps its moment — ▶ plays the recording from there
